{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1767508,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"IPL Auction","festival_id":null,"organization_id":13218,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-07T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-13T16:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/ipl-auction-ram-lal-anand-college-university-of-delhi-1767508","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>All that you need to know about the Mock IPL Auction<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>&ldquo;The Ultimate IPL Auction: Build Your Dynasty&rdquo;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Cricket is not just about big names. It is about strategy, budgets, combinations, and making the right call when the pressure is on.<\/p>\n<p>Welcome to the Mock IPL Auction, a strategy-driven competition where your team will step into the shoes of an IPL franchise management team. From identifying the right players to managing your purse and building a balanced squad, every decision could define your season.<\/p>\n<p>Do you have what it takes to build a championship-winning squad?<\/p>\n<p>Bring your cricket knowledge, sharpen your strategic thinking, and get ready to bid, bluff, calculate, and build your dream IPL team.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Rewards &amp; Prizes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exciting prizes and rewards for the top-performing teams.<\/li>\n<li>Certificates for participating teams.<\/li>\n<li>Exclusive goodies and partner benefits for winners and finalists.<\/li>\n<li>Recognition for the best auction strategy and squad-building performance.<\/li>\n<li>Exact prizes, rewards, and partner benefits will be announced by the organizers.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round 1: The Team Selection Test<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Mode:<\/strong> Online<br \/><strong>Format:<\/strong> Quiz<br \/><strong>Team Size:<\/strong> 2 to 3 members<\/p>\n<p>The journey begins with an exciting Cricket Quiz designed to test your knowledge of IPL, international cricket, players, teams, records, and the game beyond the scoreboard.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Advancement:<\/strong> The top 10 teams from Round 1 will qualify for the Mock IPL Auction.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 2: The Mock IPL Auction<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Mode:<\/strong> Off-Campus Simulation<br \/><strong>Team Size:<\/strong> 2 to 3 members<\/p>\n<p>The real battle begins.<\/p>\n<p>The top 10 teams will enter the auction simulation, where every team will be assigned an actual IPL franchise.<\/p>\n<p>Build the strongest possible squad for your franchise.<\/p>\n<p>Each participating team will receive a fixed purse and will compete in a live IPL-style auction simulation to acquire players.<\/p>\n<p><strong>You will need to:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Manage your purse strategically<\/li>\n<li>Identify valuable players<\/li>\n<li>Make smart bidding decisions<\/li>\n<li>Build a balanced squad<\/li>\n<li>Plan according to your franchise's requirements<\/li>\n<li>Adapt to changing auction dynamics<\/li>\n<li>Make every bid count<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The complete auction rules, purse details, player pool, squad requirements, bidding mechanics, and additional conditions will be revealed after Round 1.<\/p>\n<p>So come prepared for the unexpected.<\/p>\n<p>One reckless bid could drain your purse. One missed opportunity could weaken your squad. One smart acquisition could change everything.<\/p>\n<p><strong>The Ultimate Challenge<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Building a squad is easy, but building the right squad within a limited purse is the real game.<\/p>\n<p>Your team will have to balance star power with squad depth, experience with potential, and aggressive bidding with financial discipline.<\/p>\n<p>Every player has a price.<br \/>Every bid has a consequence.<br \/>Every decision matters.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Scoring &amp; Key Considerations<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Keep these factors in mind throughout the auction:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each player will carry specific points.<\/li>\n<li>The remaining purse will also contribute to the final score.<\/li>\n<li>Your squad must be completed as per the given requirements.<\/li>\n<li>The required numbers of batters, bowlers, all-rounders, international and national players must be maintained.<\/li>\n<li>All teams must follow the specified squad and auction requirements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The team with the highest final points will win.<\/p>\n<p>All major scoring rules, player points, squad requirements, and category limits will be revealed after Round 1.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to college students.<\/li>\n<li>Team size: 2 to 3 members.<\/li>\n<li>Inter-college teams may participate.<\/li>\n<li>Each team must participate in Round 1 to qualify for Round 2.<\/li>\n<li>Only the top 10 teams from Round 1 will advance to the auction simulation.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>The competition will be conducted across two rounds.<\/li>\n<li>Round 1 will be an online quiz.<\/li>\n<li>The top 10 teams from Round 1 will qualify for Round 2.<\/li>\n<li>Round 2 will be an off-campus IPL auction simulation.<\/li>\n<li>Teams will consist of 2 to 3 members.<\/li>\n<li>Each qualified team will be assigned an actual IPL franchise.<\/li>\n<li>Every team will receive a fixed purse for the auction.<\/li>\n<li>Teams must build their complete squad within the allocated purse and according to the rules revealed by the organizers.<\/li>\n<li>All players acquired during the auction simulation will be subject to the auction rules.<\/li>\n<li>Teams must manage their purse throughout the auction.<\/li>\n<li>The detailed auction format, player pool, squad requirements, purse allocation, bidding rules, and other conditions will be revealed after Round 1.<\/li>\n<li>Decisions made during the auction simulation will be final.<\/li>\n<li>Any form of malpractice, collusion, or unfair means may result in disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>The organizers reserve the right to modify the format or rules if required.<\/li>\n<li>The decision of the organizers and judging panel will be final and binding.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Your Mission<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Ten teams.<br \/>Ten franchises.<br \/>One auction floor.<br \/>One chance to build your squad.<\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":10148388,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-07T22:39:19+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-09T07:48:16+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"zO0rb1A","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":14,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-07 22:53:21","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/uploadedManual-6ac67e3a5896a_whatsapp_image_2026-09-30_at_23_16_30.jpeg","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/uploadedManual-6ac67e3a5896a_whatsapp_image_2026-09-30_at_23_16_30.jpeg","regnRequirements":{"id":2499195,"opportunity_id":1767508,"festival_id":null,"max_team_size":3,"min_team_size":2,"start_regn_dt":"2026-10-07T00:00:00+05:30","end_regn_dt":"2026-10-11T18:00:00+05:30","show_deadline":1,"open_for":0,"college_type":0,"same_organisation":0,"study_year_filter":0,"deleted_at":null,"eligibility":"{\"sec